Package: curvesweeper
Title: IRT Item Curve Diagnostic Reports from TAM Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Martín", "Fuentes-Santelices", email = "martin.fuen.san@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Rasch and 2PL item response theory models (via TAM) to
    binary item-response data and produces PDF diagnostic reports: item
    characteristic curves, Wright maps, item fit tables, and a cross-method
    (JML/CML/MML) Rasch difficulty comparison. Works with any binary
    item-response dataset and calls TAM's own native plotting/fitting
    functions directly rather than reconstructing curves by hand.
